    "updated_at": "2016-07-21T06:21:28Z",
    "body": "Looking through https://whatwg.org/specs/web-apps/2009-10-27/ I think this has always been wrong. I suspect `location.reload()` should simply do an entry update. Also asking @smaug---- to confirm to be extra sure.\n",
